      <activity id="684b46fc-5257-5ec4-af07-1c73d8535c94" activityNameId="bb8e4271-c104-50c2-8402-818a7a2fefe8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Panelling, aluminium, window casement and frame cover, wall opening, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Panelling, aluminium, window casement and frame cover, wall opening, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: 656ce89c-6be6-3a56-91c6-b6a6fabdd9b9
Included are the materials for the panelling of the casement and frame of a wood-metal window. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_656ce89c-6be6-3a56-91c6-b6a6fabdd9b9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
